  "A most ordinary trooper. Makes for a trusty all-around Corporal. His motto: \"The wise learn success from failure.\"": "平凡な平隊士。万能型伍長として最適。座右の銘は「失敗は成功のもと」。",
  "A most ordinary trooper. A fine choice for Corporal with the strength to endure any hardship. His motto: \"Maybe I'll get lucky someday.\"": "平凡な平隊士。伍長としては窮地を粘り強く耐え抜く。座右の銘は「棚からぼた餅」。",
  "A most ordinary trooper. A fine choice for Corporal with the strength to endure any hardship. His motto: \"Where there's a will, there's a way.\"": "平凡な平隊士。伍長としては窮地を粘り強く耐え抜く。座右の銘は「為せば成る」。",
  "A most ordinary trooper. A capable Corporal, though not without his own risks. His motto: \"Always set goals for yourself.\"": "平凡な平隊士。伍長とすれば有能だが、危険も伴う。座右の銘は「一念発起」。",
  "A most ordinary trooper. A capable Corporal, though not without his own risks. His motto: \"Cherish every encounter.\"": "平凡な平隊士。伍長とすれば有能だが、危険も伴う。座右の銘は「一期一会」。",
  "A most ordinary trooper. A capable Corporal, though not without his own risks. His motto: \"Success only ripens with sweat.\"": "平凡な平隊士。伍長とすれば有能だが、危険も伴う。座右の銘は「切磋琢磨」。",
