  "Seems to enjoy assisting Offensive Troopers. A capable Corporal, though not without his own risks. His motto: \"Outer conduct, inner cultivation.\"": "攻撃隊士補佐に長けた平隊士。伍長とすれば有能だが、危険も伴う。座右の銘は「品行方正」。",
